OL,3,GNEWSAParliament hosts boxing event in
OL,4,Ahonour of Grenfell
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung boxers from across London sparred
OL,7,Fin the Houses of Parliament as part of
OL,8,Fa fundraising event held in memory of
OL,9,Fthose who died in the Grenfell Tower
OL,10,Ffire.
OL,12,FIt was initiated by London's former
OL,13,Ffire commissioner, Lord Roe, who served
OL,14,Fas incident commander on the night of
OL,15,Fthe fire on 14 June 2017, when 72
OL,16,Fpeople died.
OL,18,FA boxing coach himself, Lord Roe had
OL,19,Ftrained at Dale Youth Boxing Club,
OL,20,Fwhich was based inside the tower block.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
