OL,3,GNEWSAParliament hosts boxing event in
OL,4,Ahonour of Grenfell
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those boxing was Sulayman, who
OL,7,Fsaid the fire had changed his life: "I
OL,8,Fhad family in there and it was a big
OL,9,Fevent and it caused a lot of things in
OL,10,Fmy life to change, and boxing kind of
OL,11,Fjust put me back on the right track
OL,12,Fafter such a traumatic event."
